            "  (0, 1, 1, 2, -1, 0, -1, 1, 1, 0)    left     left=4.03  jump=3.49\n",
            "  (0, 1, 1, 2, 1, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0)      right    right=4.82  idle=4.23\n",
            "  (0, 1, 1, 2, 1, 0, -1, 1, 1, 0)     right    right=4.94  idle=4.81\n",
            "  (0, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0)      right    right=5.02  left=5.00\n",
            "  (0, 1, 1, 2, -1, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0)     idle/left/right/jump/jmp_R   idle=5.00  left=5.00\n",
            "  (0, 1, 1, 2, -1, 1, -1, 1, 1, 0)    jmp_R    jmp_R=3.51  left=3.51\n",
            "  (0, 1, 1, 2, 0, 1, -1, 1, 1, 0)     idle/jump/jmp_L/jmp_R   idle=5.00  jump=5.00\n"
          ]
